BatConf Authors
===============

BatConf is written and maintained by Lundy Bernard, with contributions
from the people listed below.

The list is drawn from the commit history of the main branch, ordered
alphabetically, and covers people only: automated accounts are left
out. If you have contributed and are missing here, or would like your
name written differently, open an issue or a pull request.

- celin07
- jgafnea
- Kevin Kanigara
- Lauren Moore
- Lundy Bernard
- MhdHarshil
- Stoned
- William Laverty
